```json
{
  "stylelint": "latest",
  "stylelint-config-recommended-scss": "latest"
}
```

### What did you expect to happen?

No issue when using at-rule inside mixins.

### What actually happened?

```
3:5-21 error Unexpected invalid position declaration no-invalid-position-declaration
```

### Do you have a proposal to fix the bug?

Quite similar to https://github.com/stylelint/stylelint/issues/8728. The fix could be the same. To add the secondary option `ignoreAtRules: []` as this is a langage extension specific issue.
